{"raDiksyoryasya viprasnaH": [{"id": "rADIkzyoryasya vipraSnaH", "headword": "राधीक्ष्योर्यस्य विप्रश्नः", "headword_slp1": "rADIkzyoryasya vipraSnaH", "fold": "raDiksyoryasya viprasnaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In the case of the verbs राध् 'to propitiate' and ईक्ष् 'to look to', the person about whose good or bad fortune questions are asked is called सम्प्रदान।\n\nTerms: कारक-कर्म", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["राधीक्ष्योर्यस्य विप्रश्नः १.४.३९", "१.४.३९", "१.४.३९ राधीक्ष्योर्यस्य विप्रश्नः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["rADIkzyoryasya vipraSnaH १.४.३९", "१.४.३९", "१.४.३९ rADIkzyoryasya vipraSnaH"]}], "raDo hinsayam": [{"id": "rADo hiMsAyAm", "headword": "राधो हिंसायाम्", "headword_slp1": "rADo hiMsAyAm", "fold": "raDo hinsayam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "ए is substituted for आ of राध when meaning 'to hurt someone' and the reduplicate is elided before the affixes क् (or ङ्) or as well as before थल् of the लिट् (Perfect Tense) having the augment इट्।\n\nTerms: ए substitution", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["राधो हिंसायाम् ६.४.१२३", "६.४.१२३", "६.४.१२३ राधो हिंसायाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["rADo hiMsAyAm ६.४.१२३", "६.४.१२३", "६.४.१२३ rADo hiMsAyAm"]}], "raDijaBoraci": [{"id": "raDijaBoraci", "headword": "रधिजभोरचि", "headword_slp1": "raDijaBoraci", "fold": "raDijaBoraci", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The augment नुम् is added after the root-vowel in रध् and जभ् before affixes beginning with a consonant.\n\nTerms: नुम् augment", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["रधिजभोरचि ७.१.६१", "७.१.६१", "७.१.६१ रधिजभोरचि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["raDijaBoraci ७.१.६१", "७.१.६१", "७.१.६१ raDijaBoraci"]}], "raDadiByasca": [{"id": "raDAdiByaSca", "headword": "रधादिभ्यश्च", "headword_slp1": "raDAdiByaSca", "fold": "raDadiByasca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": 